\max{\left( \text{Base Health} \times 1.1,\quad 0.25 \times \left( \text{Base Health} + 900 \right) \times [ 2.5 + \frac{2}{15} \times (x - 35) ] \right)} ,\; & 35 < x \leq 50 \\
\max{\left( \text{Base Health} \times 1.1,\quad 0.25 \times \left( \text{Base Health} + 900 \right) \times [ 4.5 + 0.03 \times (x - 50) ] \right)} \; & 50 < x \leq 100 \\
\max{\left( \text{Base Health} \times 1.1,\quad 0.25 \times \left( \text{Base Health} + 900 \right) \times 6 \right)} ,\; & 100 > x \\
\end{cases}
}
</math>

For Eximus units with '''No''' Shields or Armor, the base health increase is as follows:

:<math>
{
\text{Eximus Health} = 
